Homepage: https://github.com/Yjlion/mitmproxy-web-filter
Description: Transparent web filtering proxy with management UI
 A mitmproxy-based web filter that runs as a system service on
 Debian/Ubuntu. Features include:
  - URL allow/block lists and site-category blocking
  - Google/Bing/DuckDuckGo/YouTube SafeSearch and Restricted Mode
  - YouTube channel allow/block lists
  - DNS-over-HTTPS query interception
  - NSFW image detection (NudeNet) and adult text classification
  - Management web UI (FastAPI + Alpine.js) on port 8000
  - Proxy Auto-Config (PAC/WPAD) generation
 .
 The proxy listens on port 8080 (configurable). Both the proxy and the
 management UI run as the unprivileged 'webfilter' system user.
